Okay, for the sake of argument, if we treat this

    A: do klama ma
    B: lo zarci

as an informal Lojban meta-textual object, while at the same
time declare this to be a well-defined Lojban "conversation",

    do klama ma fa'ai lo zarci

then what do we do about this?

   la xorxes cu cusku lu do klama ma fa'ai lo zarci

That's one "conversation", but is it one or two "texts"?

